s, and mechs, spreading your doctrine and eliminating threats to humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/e433e52819344f6f9b8d24424f3f7c0b.avif?t=1787757968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras_big/e433e52819344f6f9b8d24424f3f7c0b.webp?t=1787757968 width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fff7df491160d769f61ebf5061fff7a7.poster.avif?t=1787757968\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fff7df491160d769f61ebf5061fff7a7.webm?t=1787757968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fff7df491160d769f61ebf5061fff7a7.mp4?t=1787757968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Weakened foes can be captured and dragged back to your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind prison doors, resistance can be crushed through fear, indoctrination, execution, or conversion, until an enemy becomes a citizen, a warning to would-be rebels, or another tool of the regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/d8dca03fc8675ff78cee7c8695cf90dc.avif?t=1787757968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras_big/d8dca03fc8675ff78cee7c8695cf90dc.webp?t=1787757968 width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea