mine, gather, haul, research, and manufacture weapons, armor, food, and supplies. Watch fragile shelters become the machinery of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/9c16f1b0e065f6a28afd4d85f5325685.avif?t=1787757968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras_big/9c16f1b0e065f6a28afd4d85f5325685.webp?t=1787757968 width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/f8cce6de6f916a6192a2337c39a97a25.poster.avif?t=1787757968\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/f8cce6de6f916a6192a2337c39a97a25.webm?t=1787757968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/f8cce6de6f916a6192a2337c39a97a25.mp4?t=1787757968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Collect roguelite cores during each expedition to grow stronger, survive longer, and push deeper into enemy territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Cores reshape how your guns handle. Combination Cores create synergies between different core sets. Others strengthen the troops fighting beside you, or turn them into sacrificial shields for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run becomes a shifting war machine built around you, your squad, and the chaos you unleash together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/cd198168c39b7c9ab920fdac1aea7837.avif?t=1787757968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras_big/cd198168c39b7c9ab920fdac1aea7837.webp?t=1787757968 width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pax Autocratica is a totalitarian colony sim and FPS roguelite hybrid that combines base building, citizen management, and first-person chaotic battlefields filled with infantry, vehicles and bullet hell. It offers a dynamic, accessible, and approachable gameplay experience for all in a sci-fi dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a game about power. How it’s built, how it corrupts, and how it consumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will command armies, dictate laws, and witness consequences in every face that salutes you or fears you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will history remember your reign?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WARNING</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "short_description": "Build a grand totalitarian colony and personally storm roguelite battlefields with your soldiers. Shape citizens fears, loyalties, bonds, and feuds. Capture enemies, convert them into true believers. Sacrifice the weak. Feed the strong. Wield absolute power and make every life bend to your will.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/d492e901f3aec578ea3b3fc45c25f09784313d8c/header.jpg?t=1787757968", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/0e2383a66d23ea67d7b9618a3a53fa52ca5db032/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787757968", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/0e2383a66d23ea67d7b9618a3a53fa52ca5db032/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787757968", "website": "https://paxautocratica.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS® 10 (64-BIT Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1080p: Nvidia® GTX 1060 6G / RX 480 (6GB+ of VRAM)  |  1440p: Nvidia® GTX 1070 8G / AMD Radeon RX Vega 56 (8GB+ of VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS® 10 (64-BIT Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-8700K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600  or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia® GTX 2060 Super / RX 5700 XT (8GB+ of VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Multiverse"], "publishers": ["Multiverse"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 2999, "final": 2999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$29.99"}, "packages": [357353], "package_groups": [{"name": "d